Outrival — third-party data attribution
=======================================

GeoNames
--------
`packages/shared/src/geo/dataset.generated.ts` is built from the GeoNames
geographical database:

  - cities15000        (cities above 15,000 inhabitants, plus capitals)
  - countryInfo        (ISO 3166-1 codes, English country names, languages)
  - admin1CodesASCII   (first-level administrative subdivisions)
  - alternatenames/*   (per-country alternate place names, language-tagged)

  Source:  https://www.geonames.org/  ·  https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/
  Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0)
           https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The extract is transformed (folded to lookup keys, filtered by language and
population, and reduced to country codes plus populations) by
`packages/shared/scripts/build-geo-dataset.ts`. No GeoNames web service is
called at runtime.
